{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"3288","title":"Introducing Redmi Pad Pro: Elevating entertainment with immersive display and seamless performance","desc":"Designed for users seeking a large viewing area for immersive audiovisual entertainment, online browsing, and gaming on the go, Redmi Pad Pro features a large display for elevated visual clarity, offering unparalleled entertainment. ","view_cnt":"37504","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1714379936","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/601_operatorx_operatorx_opx/29/04/2024/bac03fb8926b4ca4e059c620c234bf1c.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e[Beijing, China, May 20th, 2024] \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- Xiaomi today announced Redmi Pad Pro, the latest addition to its tablet portfolio. Designed for users seeking a large viewing area for immersive audiovisual entertainment, online browsing, and gaming on the go, Redmi Pad Pro features a large display for elevated visual clarity, offering unparalleled entertainment. Powered by Xiaomi HyperOS for effortless cross-device connectivity, Redmi Pad Pro is the perfect companion for those looking to unwind after a day of study or work.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/386_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/17/05/2024/db824726c3614012a1579f89972bced3.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDelivering unmatched entertainment with large display and powerful audiovisual\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFeaturing an impressive 12.1-inch display with an expansive 16:10 aspect ratio, Redmi Pad Pro not only offers exceptional viewing, but also ensures optimal comfort during extended usage.¹ With its 2.5K resolution (2560 x 1600) at 249ppi, Redmi Pad Pro breathes life into every detail, providing an immersive viewing perfect for high-definition content. The 120Hz refresh rate ensures that Redmi Pad Pro delivers fluid responsiveness across various applications — from navigating documents to engaging in dynamic gaming.²\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTo further elevate entertainment, the tablet boasts quad stereo speakers integrated with Dolby Atmos® for audio enhancement. This setup allows users to immerse themselves in crisp, high-resolution sound, whether they're deeply engrossed in their favorite TV series or exploring new worlds in the latest games.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/465_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/08/05/2024/d08f7c9f50be8f11a9ab46f359daeccc.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSeamless integration and robust performance for a smooth flagship-level experience\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Pad Pro is powered by the advanced Xiaomi HyperOS, seamlessly integrating into users' daily lives, facilitating effortless content sharing, swift photo transfers, and seamless collaboration across devices.³ Powered by a Snapdragon® 7s Gen 2 Mobile Platform, it ensures smooth flagship-level reliable performance for both work and play, allowing users to transition seamlessly between tasks. With a 10000mAh (typ) battery and up to 33W fast charging, Redmi Pad Pro keeps you powered up and ready to go, ensuring uninterrupted entertainment and productivity throughout your day.⁹\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/496_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/08/05/2024/16c243759f950b49fa29fd5aa96ff265.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eInnovative accessories open the door to expanded scenarios\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Pad Pro is the first Redmi tablet to support Redmi Smart Keyboard and Redmi Smart Pen, making it the ultimate two-in-one entertainment and productivity companion.⁴ Redmi Smart Pen comes with 4096-level pressure sensitivity and a 240Hz sampling rate, offering a fluid writing experience. With an 80mAh (typ) battery that provides up to 12 hours of writing time on a single charge, users can easily capture spontaneous ideas as they arise.⁸ Meanwhile, Redmi Smart Keyboard offers a comfortable PC-like typing experience with 1.3mm key travel distance and 19mm key pitch, as well as an added pen holder for the Redmi Smart Pen, making these two accessories the perfect duo for users to effortlessly unleash their creativity and accomplish tasks with maximum efficiency on Redmi Pad Pro.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/959_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/08/05/2024/c520a359c7a82767c2c4ef4b3bd45bfa.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePrice and availability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Pad Pro is available in Graphite Gray, Mint Green, and Ocean Blue,⁵ with three variants 6GB+128GB, 8GB+128GB, and 8GB+256GB,⁶ starting from EUR 299.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct images are available \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EuwkIX2nWrlAmpyF4e39sLABYna7Sje5K800JifljoD56w?e=Do4cdB\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehere\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Pad Pro Quick Specs\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Pad Pro\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDisplay\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;12.1\" 2.5K(2560 x 1600) display at 249 ppi¹\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e120Hz AdaptiveSync refresh rate²\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBrightness: 500 nits, HBM 600 nits\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eColor Depth: 12-bit, 68.7 billion colors\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1500:1 contrast ratio\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSupports Dolby Vision®\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Hardware Solution) Certified\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certified\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certified\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eCorning® Gorilla® Glass 3 Screen Protection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePerformance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; Snapdragon® 7s Gen 2 Mobile Platform\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- 4nm Process Technology\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- CPU: Octa-core core, up to 2.4GHz\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- GPU: Qualcomm® Adreno™ GPU\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eLPDDR4X Memory + UFS 2.2 Storage\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAvailable configurations⁶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- 6GB+128GB\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- 8GB+128GB\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- 8GB+256GB\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSupports up to 1.5TB expandable storage\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eCamera and Audio\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; 8MP rear camera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-1/4\", f/2, 1.12μm\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Video Recording\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-1080p 1920x1080 30fps\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-720p 1280x720 30fps\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e8MP front camera\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-1/4\", f/2.28, 1.12μm\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Video Recording\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-1080p 1920x1080 30fps\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-720p 1280x720 30fps\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eQuad stereo speakers\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSupports Dolby Atmos® and Hi-Res Audio\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eSoftware\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; Xiaomi HyperOS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e- Home screen+³\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-Cross-device collaboration³\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-Network sync³\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e-Xiaomi Smart Hub⁷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Wi-Fi 6\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Bluetooth® 5.2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDesign\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; Robust metal unibody design\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; Colors: Graphite Gray, Mint Green, and Ocean Blue⁵\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDimensions: 280.0mm x 181.85mm x 7.52mm⁸\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; Weight: 571g⁸\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBattery and Charging\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Large 10,000mAh capacity (typ)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e33W fast charging⁹\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eUSB Type-C\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAccessories\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"476\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Redmi Pad Pro Keyboard\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eRedmi Smart Pen\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e4096-level pressure sensitivity\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e240Hz touch sampling rate\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Camphor Pro For XiaoMi Regular\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹ Redmi Pad Pro's screen size is about 12.1 inches when measured diagonally. Viewable area is smaller due to the curved corners. Measurements between individual products may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e² Refresh rate will be adjusted to 30/48/50/60/90/120Hz automatically, depending on the actual situation. Users can also set the refresh rate to 60/90/120Hz manually. Refresh rates may be limited by app support.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e³ Devices need to be logged in to the same Xiaomi account. Both the tablet and phone should turn on WLAN and Bluetooth. Interconnectivity functions support Redmi Pad Pro, Xiaomi Pad 6S Pro 12.4, Xiaomi 14, Xiaomi 14 Ultra and more. Release plans for other models will be announced at a later date. Please follow Xiaomi Community or go to \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003emi.com/global\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;for more announcements.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁴ Redmi Smart Pen and Redmi Pad Pro Keyboard are sold separately. Availability may differ across regions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁵ Color availability may vary between regions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁶ Configurations available may differ between different regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁷ Devices must be signed into the same Xiaomi account and connected to the same Local Area Network, with WLAN and Bluetooth® activated. Activate Xiaomi Smart Hub in Settings - Notifications \u0026amp; status bar.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁸ Data tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁹ 33W wired charging means the adapter output power is 33W. Actual power output may vary depending on the environment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies, with its global smartphone shipments ranked among the top three and global MAU (including smartphones and tablets) reached 641.2 million in December 2023. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 739.7 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of December 31, 2023. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2023, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the fifth year in a row, ranking 360th.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"6472","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1718846284"},"common":null}